    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but when you look at the actual arguments being made by regulators, it feels like they're mostly focused on how these companies use their data to crush smaller startups. do you think the regulators have a strong legal basis for this, or is it more about just trying to rein in companies that maybe got too powerful?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
